Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.Blueprint Name="BP_VehicleSpawnPoint"
   Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.EdGraph Name="UserConstructionScript"
   End Object
   Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.EdGraph Name="EventGraph"
   End Object
   ParentClass=/Script/Engine.PlayerStart
End Object

/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Class: BP_VehicleSpawnPoint
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Vehicle/BP_VehicleSpawnPoint
Target Parent: APlayerStart
Author: Level Designer
Description:
   Specialized racing grid spawn point for VELOCITY X.
   Defines starting grid slots with visual road surface box decals, lane index
   tags, clearance traces, and orientation vectors (+X).
================================================================================

1. COMPONENT HIERARCHY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- DefaultSceneRoot (SceneComponent)
  ├── ArrowComponent (ArrowComponent)
  │     - ArrowColor: (0.0, 0.85, 1.0, 1.0) - Cyan Forward Vector (+X)
  │     - ArrowSize: 2.5
  │
  ├── GridBoxDecal (DecalComponent)
  │     - DecalMaterial: M_GridBox_Decal_White
  │     - DecalSize: (600.0, 240.0, 50.0) cm (Standard FIA GT grid box marking)
  │     - RelativeRotation: (-90.0, 0.0, 0.0)
  │
  ├── SlotNumberText (TextRenderComponent)
  │     - Text: "01"
  │     - TextRenderColor: (0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 1.0)
  │     - WorldSize: 72.0
  │     - RelativeLocation: (280.0, -140.0, 2.0)
  │     - RelativeRotation: (90.0, 0.0, 0.0)
  │
  └── Billboard (BillboardComponent)
        - Sprite: Texture2D'/Engine/EditorResources/S_Player'

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. EXPOSED PARAMETERS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- GridSlotIndex (Integer, Editable) = 1 (1 = Pole Position, 2 = P2, etc.)
- LaneNumber (Integer, Editable) = 2 (1 = Inner Fast Lane, 2 = Middle, 3 = Outer)
- bIsPolePosition (Boolean, Editable) = False
- VehicleClassOverride (TSubclassOf<ABaseCar>) = None
- ClearanceRadiusCm (Float) = 350.0 cm (Ensures no physics overlap on spawn)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. CONSTRUCTION SCRIPT:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Function UserConstructionScript():
   // Update visual slot text
   FString SlotStr = (GridSlotIndex < 10) ? FString::Printf(TEXT("0%d"), GridSlotIndex) : FString::FromInt(GridSlotIndex);
   SlotNumberText->SetText(FText::FromString(SlotStr));

   // Tag identification for GameMode / Spawner discovery
   Tags.Empty();
   Tags.Add(FName(*FString::Printf(TEXT("GridSlot_%d"), GridSlotIndex)));
   Tags.Add(FName(*FString::Printf(TEXT("Lane_%d"), LaneNumber)));
   If (bIsPolePosition || GridSlotIndex == 1):
      Tags.Add(FName("PolePosition"));
      GridBoxDecal->SetDecalMaterial(M_GridBox_Decal_Gold);
================================================================================
*/
